{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30617","headline":"和主司王起 · 王甚夷","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春闱帝念主生成，长庆公闻两岁名。\n有蕴赤心分雨露，无私和气浃寰瀛。\n龙门乍出难胜幸，鸳侣先行是最荣。\n遥仰高峰看白雪，多惭属和意屏营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王甚夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}